+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/claims/{claimId}/remind — remind an OPEN or PENDING claim: its reminded date becomes the
+# sheet's today and REMIND is written. Refused with 422 for a claim in any other status, or one already reminded on the
+# sheet's today; nothing is stored. 404 for a claim not on the sheet.
